{"path":"filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator/depth","title":"std::filesystem::recursive_directory_iterator::depth","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::filesystem::recursive_directory_iterator::</span>depth","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator/depth","section":"filesystem","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the number of directories from the starting directory to the currently iterated directory, i.e. the current depth of the directory hierarchy.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> depth<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the number of directories from the starting directory to the currently iterated directory, i.e. the current depth of the directory hierarchy. \n</p><p>The starting directory has depth of <span class=\"texhtml\">0</span>, its subdirectories have depth <span class=\"texhtml\">1</span>, etc.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is the end iterator.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Current depth of the directory hierarchy.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws nothing.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>This example uses iteration depth to calculate the indentation of a directory tree printout.</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;filesystem&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> fs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">current_path</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">temp_directory_path</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">create_directories</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox/a/b/c\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">create_directories</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox/a/b/d/e\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ofstream\"><span class=\"kw1750\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ofstream</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox/a/b/file1.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">create_symlink</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"a\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox/syma\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">recursive_directory_iterator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n         i <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">recursive_directory_iterator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n         <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i.<span class=\"me1\">depth</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_symlink</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>symlink_status<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" -&gt; \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">read_symlink</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">remove_all</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>\"sandbox/syma\" -&gt; \"a\"\n\"sandbox/a\"\n  \"sandbox/a/b\"\n    \"sandbox/a/b/d\"\n      \"sandbox/a/b/d/e\"\n    \"sandbox/a/b/file1.txt\"\n    \"sandbox/a/b/c\"</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"filesystem","title":"Filesystem library (since C++17)"},{"path":"filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator","title":"std::filesystem::recursive_directory_iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::filesystem::recursive_directory_iterator::depth","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Returns the number of directories from the starting directory to the currently iterated directory, i.e. the current…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Current depth of the directory hierarchy."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws nothing."},{"label":"Example","note":"This example uses iteration depth to calculate the indentation of a directory tree printout."}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":143,"codeBlockCount":2}
